# The built console, committed so that an install needs no Node and no build step.
#
# `-text` because it is an artifact and not somebody's source: a contributor whose git is
# set to translate line endings would otherwise rewrite these bytes on checkout, and the
# check that proves the committed bundle is what `ui/` builds would fail on a machine
# rather than on a mistake.
#
# `-diff` and `linguist-generated` because it is minified: a review that scrolls past it
# is a review that stopped reading, and the thing worth reviewing is `ui/`.
src/ui/dist/** -text -diff linguist-generated=true
